     <td><para unique="1046874">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046876">(AVX512VL AND</para>
      <para unique="1046880">AVX512F) OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+330917"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046882">Shuffle 128-bit packed double precision floating-point values selected by imm8 from ymm2 and ymm3/m256/m64bcst and place results in ymm1 subject to writemask k1.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1046850">EVEX.512.66.0F3A.W1 23 /r ib</para>
      <para unique="1046851">VSHUFF64x2 zmm1{k1}{z}, zmm2, zmm3/m512/m64bcst, imm8</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046855">A</para>
