     <td><para unique="1046865">Shuffle 128-bit packed double precision floating-point values selected by imm8 from zmm2 and zmm3/m512/m64bcst and place results in zmm1 subject to writemask k1.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1046833">EVEX.256.66.0F3A.W0 43 /r ib</para>
      <para unique="1046834">VSHUFI32X4 ymm1{k1}{z}, ymm2, ymm3/m256/m32bcst, imm8</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046838">A</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046840">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046842">(AVX512VL AND</para>
      <para unique="1046846">AVX512F) OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+347010"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046848">Shuffle 128-bit packed double-word values selected by imm8 from ymm2 and ymm3/m256/m32bcst and place results in ymm1 subject to writemask k1.</para>
