     <td><para unique="1046831">Shuffle 128-bit packed double-word values selected by imm8 from zmm2 and zmm3/m512/m32bcst and place results in zmm1 subject to writemask k1.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1046799">EVEX.256.66.0F3A.W1 43 /r ib</para>
      <para unique="1046800">VSHUFI64X2 ymm1{k1}{z}, ymm2, ymm3/m256/m64bcst, imm8</para>
